Suggestions and Offers", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the modals <span class=\"italic\">could</span>, <span class=\"italic\">should</span> or <span class=\"italic\">might</span> to suggest something.  When someone offers suggestions, it is important to respond politely.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Here is a list of expressions you can use to give suggestions: <ul><li>You might want to \u2026</li><li> Would you mind \u2026 ?</li><li> You should \u2026</li><li> You ought to \u2026 (strong request)</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Offering Suggestions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Responding to Offers and Suggestions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>You might want to \u2026</li><li> Would you mind \u2026 ?</li><li> You should \u2026</li><li> You ought to \u2026 (strong request)</li></ul>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>I don't think I can \u2026</li><li> I guess that could ...</li><li> That would be ...</li>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\"\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": " How about we have a party next week? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Yes, I guess that could work.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I'm thinking a dozen guests, maybe.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Maybe 6 or 8 would be just enough to have a good conversation.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "VIP ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "Very Important Person; an important guest ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I have a few VIP guests coming next week.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le16ob01aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when you plan a party.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{